  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Action to support Developing Countries Fighting Corruption - UKACT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Action Against Corruption - UKACT -  The programme tackles corruption in ODA eligible countries by enabling the tracing, confiscation and return of stolen assets as well as investigation of bribery cases in ODA countries, by UK law enforcement. This directly impacts corruption in developing countries, where that corruption has a link to UK nationals or companies or their agents, or the UK&#x2019;s financial markets.)</narrative>
  </description>
